{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"report_supported\": \"partly\",\n  \"judge_supported\": \"partly\",\n  \"report_quotes\": [\n    \"STN local field potential recordings during gait were analyzed from four individuals with Parkinson’s disease from a previously published dataset(16).\",\n    \"Using Shannon entropy alone, the model achieved strong classification performance (AUC = 0.825, accuracy = 0.773), reliably separating pre-freeze from stable turns across patients (Figure 1D).\",\n    \"preprint (which was not certified by peer review)\",\n    \"doi: bioRxiv preprint\"\n  ],\n  \"judge_quotes\": [\n    \"preprint (which was not certified by peer review)\",\n    \"STN local field potential recordings during gait were analyzed from four individuals with Parkinson’s disease from a previously published dataset(16).\",\n    \"Predictive performance was assessed using leave-one-patient-out logistic regression and threshold classifiers.\",\n    \"Using Shannon entropy alone, the model achieved strong classification performance (AUC = 0.825, accuracy = 0.773), reliably separating pre-freeze from stable turns across patients (Figure 1D).\",\n    \"Across models, entropy consistently provided the most robust and generalizable discrimination between pre-freeze and stable turns, and additional features did not yield meaningful improvements beyond this single measure.\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"报告的核心数据有明确依据：论文确实分析了4名帕金森病患者的STN局部场电位数据，并报告基于Shannon entropy的患者留一交叉验证AUC为0.825。但论文明确标注为bioRxiv预印本，并明确注明未经同行评审。因此，如果报告正文确实没有标明预印本状态，则属于遗漏重要文献状态限定，评级为partly，而不是no。指控者的描述同样有部分充分依据：预印本状态、4名受试者和leave-one-patient-out方法均由原文明确记载。论文没有报告独立外部验证队列，因此不能将内部患者留一交叉验证等同于独立外部验证。仅凭4名患者得到的AUC=0.825，也不足以证明稳定、可推广的跨患者预测性能。不过，后两点属于对研究设计和证据强度的合理方法学判断，并非论文明确作出的结论；论文实际上使用了'reliably separating ... across patients'及'robust and generalizable discrimination'等表述。因此，指控者的核心谨慎性判断有依据，但不能说这些限制是论文作者明确承认的结论。另需说明，附件只有论文全文，无法独立核实报告第五章5.5是否确实遗漏了预印本标注。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "e022296c-07ee-4baf-84a1-61c98abfd2b6", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261113T114623395187Z", "elapsed_seconds": 82.235, "completed_utc": "2026-11-13T11:47:45.643280+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "f92a2e70db25a8fe3c185ff08029cf2b9a49e8303c30ef900be2b969550f5344", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261113T114623395187Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "2171d7d9f631f8bd5352d0d57d47959e7c481c2ea0471ee45f8420a8dd799c36"}}}
